file=Ops & Delivery/capacity/operational/principles/capacity-principles.md · c·p:capacity \· principles=> Universal-only.\n\n1. **Sustainable pace only.** No overtime assumption.\n2. **PTO honoured** as unavailable.\n3. **Meeting overhead subtracted** honestly.\n4. **Attrition rate is real**, not zero.\n5. **Loaded costs**, not salary-only.\n6. **Automate-first bias** — check `meta` before hiring.\n7. **Never decides.** Feeds marcus + felix + board.\n8. **Ranges** on forecast projections.\n9. **Provenance:** `[HR roster date]` `[calendar snapshot]` `[felix cost model]`.\n10. **Verification-before-completion inherited.**\n